              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிறந்த — ciṟanta — \"best, finest\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிறந்த (ciṟanta) is native Dravidian. DEDR 2589 lists Malayalam ciṟakka, \"to be glorious\". It is a participle of ciṟa, \"to be eminent, to excel\"."
            }
          ]
        },
